  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR Refugee Response Ukraine, 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution provides support for UNHCRs operation in Ukraine. The contribution focus on providing emergency relief addressing displacement and humanitarian challenges tied to the winter period of 2022-2023. The contribution provide support to, among others, the official targets of UNHCR including: distribution of non-food items for 567,000 people, protection support to 1,2 million people, shelter assistance for 140,000 people and home repairs for 24,600 people. This is a supplementary contribution. UNHCR previously received contribution of DKK 25 M to UNHCR&#x2019;s operations in Ukraine. The present contribution of DKK 30 M increases the total commitment to DKK 55 Mio.:</narrative>
  </description>
